Patch against dirkjanm/PKINITtools gettgtpkinit.py

GroupPolicy_Audit issues ECDSA P-256. Stock PKINITtools CMS is RSA-SHA1.

1. Load the PFX with cryptography (PKCS8 EC).
2. If the key is EllipticCurvePrivateKey:
   - digest SHA-256 (not SHA-1)
   - signature algorithm 1.2.840.10045.4.3.2 (ecdsa-with-SHA256)
   - crypto_key.sign(..., ECDSA(SHA256()))
3. Optional clock skew: datetime.now(timezone.utc) + timedelta(seconds=int(os.environ['KRB_SKEW_SEC']))

